DragonFruit support system, native Rust port
============================================

This crate is a file-by-file transliteration of the support system of:

  DragonFruit, Open Resin Alliance and contributors
  https://github.com/Open-Resin-Alliance/DragonFruit
  SynrgStudio private downstream revision f331fc555abb31c4bcb28d1a358edb887f0afe07

DragonFruit is licensed AGPL-3.0-or-later (root README and LICENSE of the
reference checkout). Each module names the DragonFruit file it was ported from
in its header. Algorithms, constants, names, comments and behaviour are kept;
TypeScript/React/three.js plumbing is replaced by plain Rust. The port remains a
derivative work under AGPL-3.0-or-later and is not relicensed by being
translated. SoulCrafted Slicer is itself AGPL-3.0.

src/three/ transliterates the subset of three.js r181 math the support code
calls (Vector3, Quaternion, Line3, Ray, MathUtils), keeping three.js operation
order so floating-point results match DragonFruit.

